+        running a regular expression. It normalizes pre-release strings. The
+        ``release=`` keyword argument is required.
+
+        >>> Version.from_parts(release=(1,2,3))
+        <Version('1.2.3')>
+        >>> Version.from_parts(release=(0,1,0), pre=("b", 1))
+        <Version('0.1.0b1')>
