+        ********************************************************************************
+        `encoding="utf-8"` fails with {file!r}, trying `encoding={fallback_encoding!r}`.
+
+        This fallback behaviour is considered **deprecated** and future versions of
+        `setuptools/pkg_resources` may not implement it.
